Our agenda for tomorrow's 8 am is:

- Immigration plan
- Clinton Cash update

Just to remind everyone that these are our standing meetings/calls going
forward:

*Monday, Wednesday, Friday 8 am Call*

*Week & Month Look Ahead - Thursdays*
Normally this call will be every Thursday, but due to scheduling conflicts
this week it will be Friday at 1 pm.  It will be a one hour call and then
every other week it will be a 2 hour in-person meeting.   The first
in-person meeting will be on May 14.  Marissa is scheduling it with your
offices.




-- 
Kristina Schake
Hillary for America

